config SSD1681_EXPERIMENTAL_INTERRUPT_FRAME_TX
    bool "Use interrupt-backed SPI for long SSD1681 transfers"
    default n
    help
        Use spi_device_transmit for transfers of at least 1000 bytes (full or
        row-windowed display planes) while keeping register writes and short
        plane windows on the polling path.
        Validated in the power lab; enabled in the project defaults.
